---
source: crates/tachy/src/components/help.rs
expression: t.backend()
---
"┌ Help — tachy 0.1.0 ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐"
"│ Normal · Navigation                                                          │"
"│ h ←              move the cursor left                                        │"
"│ j ↓              move the cursor down                                        │"
"│ k ↑              move the cursor up                                          │"
"│ l →              move the cursor right                                       │"
"│ ctrl-d           half a page down                                            │"
"│ ctrl-u           half a page up                                              │"
"│ PgDn             one page down                                               │"
"│ PgUp             one page up                                                 │"
"│ Home             go to the first row                                         │"
"│ G                go to the last row (so far, while a filter is running)      │"
"│ 0                go to the first column                                      │"
"│ $                go to the last column                                       │"
"│ w                next column (skips frozen)                                  │"
"│ b                previous column (skips frozen)                              │"
"│ g                go to a row, N% or a column name                            │"
"│                                                                              │"
"│ query:  == != < <= > >=  ~ regex  contains starts ends                       │"
"│ "x"i case-insensitive  in [..]  is [not] null  && || !  and or not           │"
"│ `col name`  $1                                                               │"
"│ goto:  g 50%  = the middle of the file by bytes while indexing,              │"
"│ the middle row once indexed                                                  │"
"└─ k/j scroll  PgUp/PgDn page  Home/G top/bottom  ?/Esc close ─── 1–17 of 129 ─┘"
